description:
Re-slice of CQ-I06 (task-4e412148), on architect-8419009e's spec (#architects msg-c3c72ad1, 16:08Z). The spec is CQ-I06's plan step 2, "DOCS SWEEP for the CQ-I epic", carried over unchanged. This slice needs R13's landed code but none of its certification reports. Everything it documents is DONE: I03, I05, I06a-d. It can therefore run now instead of waiting behind R13's operator certification and V12.

Files (only these three):
- docs/DEVELOPMENT.md
- moe-vscode/README.md
- moe-jetbrains/src/main/resources/META-INF/plugin.xml
No other open row plans them except the parent I06, which now dependsOn this slice. V12 owns MCP_SERVER, SCHEMA, ARCHITECTURE, CONFIGURATION and the CLAUDE.md files, not these.

Scope:
1. docs/DEVELOPMENT.md '## Plugin Bundling'. Replace the tree, which today lists only moe-agent.ps1/.sh under scripts/, with what both bundles ship after CQ-I06c (JetBrains `<plugin>/`, VS Code `bundled/`). Name the guards:
   - the bundlers' required-asset lists, which fail the build;
   - the packaged checks in `node scripts/tests/onboarding.mjs <extracted bundle>`;
   - scripts/tests/local-runner-bundle.test.mjs.
2. docs/DEVELOPMENT.md: a short '### Client verification record (CQ-I)' table of what proves each contract, where it runs, and what is NOT certified. It covers:
   - /ws CLIENT_HELLO and approval admission;
   - the shared verdict corpus;
   - packaging;
   - Windows engines;
   - native provider smoke (operator-invoked, never in CI);
   - the headless-only scope;
   - verified-local staying unavailable.
   The native row cites the landed `cli.mjs certify --work-dir <abs>` and links docs/CERTIFICATION.md '## Certified platforms' rather than restating per-platform state. Keep run counts, versions and dates out of the doc.
3. Managed VMs user docs:
   - moe-vscode/README.md: Features, Getting started, Commands (exact titles from the landed package.json), and one Known issues line;
   - the plugin.xml <description> <li>.
Read the landed code first: CQ-I03 (ManagedVmPresentation.kt, ManagedVmPanel.kt, MoeBundle.properties) and CQ-I05 (moe-vscode/src/util/ManagedVm.ts, its tree provider, package.json contributes). Claim nothing beyond them.

CQ-I06's step 1 (ci.yml wiring of local-runner-vm-control.test.mjs) already landed (b556875e) and is not part of this slice.

